1. `[1, 2, 3, 4]` with page size 2 → `[[1, 2], [3, 4]]` (full pages)
2. `[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]` with page size 2 → `[[1, 2], [3, 4], [5]]` (last item on its own page)
3. `[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]` with page size 2 → `[[1, 2], [3, 4], [5, 6]]` (all full pages)
4. `[1, 2, 3]` with page size 3 → `[[1, 2, 3]]` (single page)
5. `[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]` with page size 3 → `[[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7]]` (last item on its own page)

